# Diagnostics run to its renderer step (source/diag_render.c), whose
# frame-cycles figures are the emulator's in tests/perf/budget.txt: the cart
# compares its own with them. The shot is the list it scrolls (its page shows
# the figures, which change with any change to the code).
# Diagnostics from L+R+SELECT held at power-on (B17 moves it to Info), A
# once its first page is up and those keys are let go
-k 1:L+R+SELECT
-w "screen ready: diag-start"
-k 60:-
-k @40:A -k @44:-
-w "screen ready: diag-demo"
-s @1:demo.png
-w "frame-cycles: diag-page"
